msgid "Zinn® Order Updates"
msgstr "Zinn® Order Updates"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store's own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste."
msgstr "Pembaruan pesanan melalui SMS dan WhatsApp untuk toko Anda, dikirimkan melalui Zinn® Campaigns atas nama toko Anda sendiri. Hubungkan dalam satu klik; tidak perlu menempelkan kunci apa pun."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-order-updates.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:76
msgid "Read and send SMS and WhatsApp order updates for this store."
msgstr "Baca dan kirim pembaruan pesanan melalui SMS dan WhatsApp untuk toko ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:91
msgid "The WooCommerce order ID."
msgstr "ID pesanan WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:97
msgid "Get order messages"
msgstr "Dapatkan pesan pesanan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:98
msgid "Lists every SMS or WhatsApp update for one order, newest first, with its outcome. The phone number is masked."
msgstr "Mencantumkan setiap pembaruan SMS atau WhatsApp untuk satu pesanan, yang terbaru terlebih dahulu, beserta hasilnya. Nomor telepon disamarkan."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:130
msgid "Send an order update"
msgstr "Kirim pembaruan pesanan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:131
msgid "Sends one approved order update (never free text) to the shopper of the order, only if they agreed to receive it. Reusing a request_id never sends twice."
msgstr "Mengirimkan satu pembaruan pesanan yang disetujui (tidak pernah teks bebas) kepada pembeli pesanan, hanya jika mereka setuju untuk menerimanya. Menggunakan kembali request_id tidak akan pernah mengirimkan dua kali."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:140
msgid "Which approved update to send."
msgstr "Pembaruan disetujui mana yang akan dikirim."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:145
msgid "A unique ID for this send (8 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores). Send the same ID again to retry safely."
msgstr "ID unik untuk pengiriman ini (8 hingga 64 huruf, angka, titik, tanda hubung, atau garis bawah). Kirim ID yang sama lagi untuk mencoba kembali dengan aman."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:150
msgid "Optional https tracking link for a shipped update."
msgstr "Tautan pelacakan https opsional untuk pembaruan yang dikirim."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:181
msgid "Get connection health"
msgstr "Dapatkan status koneksi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:182
msgid "Shows whether this store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns and what Zinn® Campaigns sees for it."
msgstr "Menampilkan apakah toko ini terhubung ke Zinn® Campaigns dan apa yang dilihat Zinn® Campaigns untuk toko tersebut."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:250
msgid "Choose one of the approved order updates."
msgstr "Pilih salah satu pembaruan pesanan yang disetujui."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:253
msgid "The request ID must be 8 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores."
msgstr "ID permintaan harus terdiri dari 8 hingga 64 huruf, angka, titik, tanda hubung, atau garis bawah."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:292
msgid "Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns first."
msgstr "Hubungkan toko ini ke Zinn® Campaigns terlebih dahulu."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:296
msgid "There is no order with that ID on this store."
msgstr "Tidak ada pesanan dengan ID tersebut di toko ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:309
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns could not be reached. Try again in a minute."
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns tidak dapat dijangkau. Coba lagi dalam satu menit."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-abilities.php:317
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns refused the request."
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns menolak permintaan tersebut."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:35
msgid "Order Updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan Pesanan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:89
msgid "Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns."
msgstr "Toko Anda terhubung ke Zinn® Campaigns."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:90
msgid "Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent."
msgstr "Toko Anda terputus. Tidak ada pesan yang akan dikirim."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:91
msgid "That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again."
msgstr "Koneksi tersebut memakan waktu terlalu lama atau dimulai di peramban lain. Tekan Hubungkan lagi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:92
msgid "Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support."
msgstr "Zinn® tidak menerima koneksi. Tekan \"Hubungkan\" lagi; jika masih gagal, hubungi dukungan Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:93
msgid "Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again."
msgstr "Situs Anda tidak dapat menjangkau Zinn®. Periksa apakah penyedia hosting Anda mengizinkan koneksi keluar, lalu tekan «Hubungkan kembali»."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:128
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:58
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:59
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Bantuan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:131
msgid "Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store's own name, paid from your Zinn® credit."
msgstr "Kirimkan pembaruan SMS dan WhatsApp kepada pelanggan Anda tentang pesanan mereka, atas nama toko Anda sendiri, dibayar dari kredit Zinn® Anda."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:132
msgid "Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key."
msgstr "Hubungkan membuka Zinn® di jendela ini. Masuk atau buat akun, setujui toko ini, dan Anda akan langsung kembali ke sini. Anda tidak perlu menempelkan kunci."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:133
msgid "Connect to Zinn® Campaigns"
msgstr "Hubungkan ke Zinn® Campaigns"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:139
msgid "Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly."
msgstr "Terhubung, tetapi Zinn® tidak dapat dihubungi saat ini. Kami akan mencoba lagi segera."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:144
msgid "Store"
msgstr "Toko"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:150
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Terhubung"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:155
msgid "Zinn® Campaigns"
msgstr "Zinn® Campaigns"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:157
msgid "Open for your account"
msgstr "Terbuka untuk akun Anda"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:158
msgid "Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is."
msgstr "Belum terbuka untuk akun Anda. Zinn® akan mengirimkan email kepada Anda jika sudah siap."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-admin.php:162
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Putuskan sambungan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-connect.php:77
msgid "You are not allowed to connect this store."
msgstr "Anda tidak diizinkan untuk menghubungkan toko ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-connect.php:152
msgid "You are not allowed to disconnect this store."
msgstr "Anda tidak diizinkan untuk memutuskan sambungan toko ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-events.php:83
msgid "Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop."
msgstr "Kirimkan pembaruan pesanan kepada saya melalui SMS ke nomor telepon saya. Tarif pesan dan data mungkin berlaku. Balas STOP untuk berhenti."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:46
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Koneksi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:98
msgid "You are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk melakukan hal tersebut."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:225
msgid "Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support."
msgstr "Terima kasih. Anda sekarang dapat meminta bantuan dan mengirim laporan ke dukungan Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:226
msgid "Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again."
msgstr "Persetujuan ditarik. Tidak ada yang dikirim ke dukungan Zinn® sampai Anda setuju kembali."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:227
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:367
msgid "The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply."
msgstr "AI Zinn® tidak dapat menjawab saat ini. Kirimkan pertanyaan Anda ke tim di bawah ini; seseorang akan membalasnya."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:228
msgid "Glad that solved it."
msgstr "Senang hal itu telah menyelesaikannya."

#. translators: %s: the ticket reference, such as ZT-7KQ3MX.
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:230
#, php-format
msgid "Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail."
msgstr "Terkirim. Tiket Anda adalah %s; tim akan membalas di sini dan melalui email."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:231
msgid "Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address."
msgstr "Isi subjek, pesan, dan, selama toko Anda belum terhubung, alamat email Anda."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:232
msgid "Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com."
msgstr "Zinn® tidak menerima tiket. Periksa kolom-kolomnya dan coba lagi; jika terus gagal, kirim email ke support@zinndigital.com."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:233
msgid "Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr "Terlalu banyak permintaan dalam waktu singkat. Harap tunggu beberapa menit dan coba lagi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:234
msgid "Reply sent."
msgstr "Balasan terkirim."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:235
msgid "That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead."
msgstr "Tiket tersebut sudah ditutup. Kirimkan tiket baru sebagai gantinya."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:236
msgid "Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Balasan Anda tidak dapat dikirim. Coba lagi beberapa saat lagi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:251
msgid "Waiting on Zinn® support"
msgstr "Menunggu dukungan Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:253
msgid "Waiting on you"
msgstr "Menunggu Anda"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:255
msgid "Answered"
msgstr "Dijawab"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:257
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "Ditutup"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:270
msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Laporkan bug"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:272
msgid "Send feedback"
msgstr "Kirim masukan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:274
msgid "Request a feature"
msgstr "Minta fitur"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:276
msgid "Ask for help"
msgstr "Minta bantuan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:287
msgid "Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected"
msgstr "Versi: WordPress, PHP, plugin ini, WooCommerce (dan apakah menggunakan HPOS) serta plugin yang didukung yang kami deteksi"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:289
msgid "Your active theme and its version"
msgstr "Tema aktif Anda dan versinya"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:291
msgid "The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active"
msgstr "Daftar plugin yang terpasang, versinya, dan apakah masing-masing aktif"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:293
msgid "Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install's id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store's token)"
msgstr "Koneksi: alamat toko Anda, apakah terhubung, id instalasi ini, dan apakah Zinn® menjawab pemeriksaan terakhirnya (tidak pernah berupa token toko)"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:314
msgid "Zinn® Order Updates: Help"
msgstr "Pembaruan Pesanan Zinn®: Bantuan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:328
msgid "Withdraw my consent to send help requests"
msgstr "Tarik persetujuan saya untuk mengirim permintaan bantuan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:336
msgid "Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:"
msgstr "Bantuan di sini dijawab oleh Zinn Digital® Ltd. Sebelum apa pun keluar dari situs Anda, inilah tepatnya apa yang dikirimkan, dan ke mana:"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:338
msgid "A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles."
msgstr "Pertanyaan yang Anda ketik: dikirim ke Zinn® AI di api.zinndigital.com, yang menjawab berdasarkan artikel bantuan Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:339
msgid "A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support."
msgstr "Tiket yang Anda kirim: subjeknya, pesan Anda, bahasa admin Anda, dan alamat email balasan, dikirim ke dukungan Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:340
msgid "Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store's token, passwords or your customers' details."
msgstr "Diagnostik: hanya blok yang Anda centang, masing-masing ditampilkan secara lengkap sebelum Anda kirim. Tidak akan pernah menyertakan token toko, kata sandi, atau detail pelanggan Anda."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:341
msgid "Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team's replies from Zinn®."
msgstr "Tiket Anda: saat toko Anda terhubung, layar ini membaca tiket Anda dan balasan tim dari Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:343
msgid "We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen."
msgstr "Kami mencatat siapa yang menyetujui dan kapan. Anda dapat menarik persetujuan kapan saja di layar ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:345
msgid "Agree and continue"
msgstr "Setuju dan lanjutkan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:354
msgid "Ask the Zinn® AI"
msgstr "Tanyakan kepada AI Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:356
msgid "What do you need help with?"
msgstr "Ada yang bisa kami bantu?"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:358
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "Tanyakan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:373
msgid "Help articles"
msgstr "Artikel bantuan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:388
msgid "That solved it"
msgstr "Ini menyelesaikan masalahnya"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:389
msgid "Still need help? Send it to the team below."
msgstr "Masih membutuhkan bantuan? Kirimkan ke tim di bawah ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:401
msgid "Send it to the Zinn® team"
msgstr "Kirimkan ke tim Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:406
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "Apa ini?"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:411
msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Subjek"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:412
msgid "What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it."
msgstr "Apa yang terjadi? Untuk bug, sebutkan langkah-langkah yang menunjukkannya."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:413
msgid "Reply e-mail"
msgstr "Email balasan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:416
msgid "Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store."
msgstr "Biarkan kosong untuk menggunakan email anggota Zinn® yang menghubungkan toko ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:420
msgid "Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail."
msgstr "Toko Anda belum terhubung, sehingga tim membalas melalui email."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:423
msgid "Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent."
msgstr "Diagnostik (opsional). Centang blok untuk melampirkannya; ini adalah apa yang dikirimkan."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:430
msgid "Send to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Kirim ke dukungan Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:439
msgid "My tickets"
msgstr "Tiket saya"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:441
msgid "Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail."
msgstr "Hubungkan toko Anda untuk memantau tiket Anda di sini. Hingga saat itu tiba, tim akan membalas melalui email."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:446
msgid "Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Tiket Anda tidak dapat dimuat saat ini. Silakan coba lagi sebentar lagi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:451
msgid "No tickets yet."
msgstr "Belum ada tiket."

#. translators: %s: the date and time of the reply.
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:469
#, php-format
msgid "Zinn® support replied on %s:"
msgstr "Dukungan Zinn® membalas pada %s:"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:476
msgid "Your reply"
msgstr "Balasan Anda"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-help.php:478
msgid "Send reply"
msgstr "Kirim balasan"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:85
msgid "Zinn Digital®"
msgstr "Zinn Digital®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:130
msgid "Zinn® SMS and WhatsApp sign-up"
msgstr "Pendaftaran SMS dan WhatsApp Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:139
msgid "Lets visitors sign up for offers and news by SMS or WhatsApp. Unticked by default; marketing only."
msgstr "Memungkinkan pengunjung mendaftar untuk mendapatkan penawaran dan berita melalui SMS atau WhatsApp. Tidak dicentang secara default; hanya untuk pemasaran."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:140
msgid "Sign-up settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan pendaftaran"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:141
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Saluran"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:145
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:259
msgid "SMS"
msgstr "SMS"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:149
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:260
msgid "WhatsApp"
msgstr "WhatsApp"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:153
msgid "Visitor chooses SMS or WhatsApp"
msgstr "Pengunjung memilih SMS atau WhatsApp"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:162
msgid "Zinn® SMS offers consent"
msgstr "Persetujuan penawaran SMS Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:162
msgid "Zinn® WhatsApp offers consent"
msgstr "Persetujuan penawaran WhatsApp Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:163
msgid "Records a marketing opt-in in Zinn® Campaigns for the phone number in this form."
msgstr "Mencatat persetujuan pemasaran di Zinn® Campaigns untuk nomor telepon dalam formulir ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:184
msgid "Send me offers and news on WhatsApp to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time."
msgstr "Kirimi saya penawaran dan kabar terbaru di WhatsApp ke nomor ini. Opsional; berhenti berlangganan kapan saja."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:185
msgid "Send me offers and news by SMS to this number. Optional; unsubscribe any time by replying STOP. Message and data rates may apply."
msgstr "Kirimi saya penawaran dan kabar terbaru melalui SMS ke nomor ini. Opsional; berhenti berlangganan kapan saja dengan membalas STOP. Biaya pesan dan data mungkin berlaku."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:243
msgid "Connect this store to Zinn® Campaigns to show this sign-up form."
msgstr "Hubungkan toko ini ke Zinn® Campaigns untuk menampilkan formulir pendaftaran ini."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:255
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-preferences.php:389
msgid "Mobile number"
msgstr "Nomor ponsel"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:258
msgid "How should we send them?"
msgstr "Bagaimana kami sebaiknya mengirimkannya?"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:261
#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:402
msgid "Send me offers and news by the channel I chose above. Optional; unsubscribe any time."
msgstr "Kirimi saya penawaran dan berita melalui saluran yang saya pilih di atas. Opsional; Anda dapat berhenti berlangganan kapan saja."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:267
msgid "Leave this empty"
msgstr "Biarkan ini kosong"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:275
msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Mendaftar"

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:287
msgid "Thank you, you are signed up. You can unsubscribe any time."
msgstr "Terima kasih, Anda telah terdaftar. Anda dapat berhenti berlangganan kapan saja."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:289
msgid "Please enter your mobile number with its country code, for example +44 7700 900123."
msgstr "Silakan masukkan nomor ponsel Anda beserta kode negaranya, misalnya +44 7700 900123."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:291
msgid "Please tick the box to agree."
msgstr "Centang kotak ini untuk menyetujui."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:293
msgid "This form was open for a long time. Please reload the page and send it again."
msgstr "Formulir ini telah terbuka untuk waktu yang lama. Silakan muat ulang halaman dan kirimkan kembali."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:295
msgid "Too many sign-ups from here. Please wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr "Terlalu banyak pendaftaran dari sini. Silakan tunggu beberapa menit dan coba lagi."

#: includes/class-zinn-order-updates-optin.php:297
